ferrite (0.9.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Pre-release version bump. Reflects working ferrited daemon, multi-arch
    package matrix (amd64 + arm64 + riscv64), and the expanded SoapySDR
    driver bundle (RTL-SDR, HackRF, SDRplay, Airspy R2 / HF+, BladeRF,
    PlutoSDR).

